===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fiu-fin-pro|fi}} {{m|fiu-fin-pro|*pää}}, from {{etyl|urj-pro|fi}} {{m|urj-pro|*päŋe}}. Cognates include Estonian {{term|lang=et|pea}}, Veps {{term|lang=vep|pä}} and Hungarian {{term|lang=hu|fej}}, {{term|lang=hu|fő}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|lang=fi|/pæː/}}
* {{rhymes|æː|lang=fi}}
* {{hyphenation|pää|lang=fi}}

===Noun===
{{fi-noun}}

# [[head]] (of an organism or organisation)
# [[end]], [[tip]] (physical end)

